NOTE ON PROVENANCE: This codebase is an independent implementation of
published, peer-reviewed rPPG/HRV algorithms (Balakrishnan et al., CVPR 2013;
de Haan & Jeanne, IEEE TBME 2013; Wang et al., IEEE TBME 2016; Poh, McDuff &
Picard, Optics Express / IEEE TBME 2010-2011; Lewandowska et al., FedCSIS
2011; Verkruysse, Svaasand & Nelson, Optics Express 2008 — see individual
module docstrings for per-algorithm citations). It was built using the
MediaPipe Face Landmarker Tasks API, not any code from
github.com/irfan798/head-pulse-track. That repository (unlicensed, all
rights reserved by its authors) is credited in README.md /
docs/research_report.md as the scientific inspiration that first pointed at
Balakrishnan et al. (2013) for this problem — no source code from it is
reused here. See README.md "Acknowledgements" for details.
